                                                  <history>
                                                            <origin>
                                                            <p>Written in <origPlace>Norway</origPlace>, probably in the Bergen area, in <origDate notBefore="1270" notAfter="1280">c. 1275</origDate>.</p>
                                                            <p>Ludvig Holm-Olsen believes that the manuscript was copied from an exemplar from the South-Eastern part of Norway, and that the scribe had
                                                                      been trained in Bergen. For this reason, there are Eastern as well as Western Norwegian traits in the orthography of the
                                                                      manuscript.</p>
                                                            </origin>
                                                  </history>
